# July Class Dates Announced

_July class dates announced for your next drum and dance class!_ There will be lots of action as usual with African drum and dance classes held on Tuesday nights and Saturday mornings. The new times will mean all drumming students will have the opportunity to drum for the dancers (or dance!) and the experienced drummers will get to warm up at the dance class before the drums begin. Win win for everyone! All classes run as a 5 week course and you can [book in online](/product-category/drum-classes/). Be sure to pop these new times and dates in your diary: 5 week course African Drumming Tuesdays (starts July 14th) Beginners 5.30pm **Experienced 7.30pm (please note new time)** @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall 1 Main St, Palmwoods 5 week course African Dancing Tuesdays (Starts July 14th) **Open Class 6.30pm (please note new time)** @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall 1 Main St, Palmwoods 5 Week Course African Dancing Saturdays (Starts July 18th) **Beginners 9am** Bookings essential **@Palmwoods Girl Guide Hut** cnr Lingara Ave and Palmwoods-Montville Rd
